image: "/blog/drill-bits.jpg"
layout: layouts/base.njk
templateEngineOverride: njk
---
<div class="kh-u-background-color--yellow--dark kh-u-fullbleed">
<section class="kh-grid-stylized kh-u-padding__top--500 kh-u-padding__bottom--500">
  <div></div>
  <div class="kh-content">
    <h1 class="kh-font-headline kh-text-heading--1">
      <div class="kh-font-headline--display">{{title}}.</div>
      <div class="kh-font-headline--display">
        <span class="kh-u-text--nowrap">I am</span> Ken Hawkins.
      </div>
    </h1>
    <h2 class="kh-text-heading--2">I lead platform architecture and design systems that make delivery faster and organizations more capable.</h2>
    {% markdown -%}

    With [20 years experience](/cv/) leading digital strategy for science, media, and UN organizations, I help teams navigate from complex challenges to AI-ready platforms that [deliver](/posts/20180122-content-action-model.html) measurable organizational transformation.

    At UNDRR I serve as product owner for a 15-site Drupal 10 ecosystem—50–70% faster, 20% cheaper, +40% campaign engagement. I bridge communications and technical teams to align shared architecture, structured content, and predictable releases.

    See recent <a href="/work/">case studies</a>: UNDRR platform transformation, EMBL Visual Framework, scaled Drupal with commerce.

    <hr>

    {% set latestDigesting = collections.digesting | reverse | first %}
    <p id="digesting">Currently digesting: <a href="{{ latestDigesting.url }}">{{ latestDigesting.data.title }}</a></p>

    {%- endmarkdown %}
  </div>
</section>
</div>

<section class="kh-card-container kh-grid-stylized">
  <span></span>
  <section>
    <h2 id="recently" class="kh-text-heading--2">Recently</h2>
    {%- for post in collections.posts.slice(-10) | reverse -%}
    {%- if not (post.data.tags and ('case-studies' in post.data.tags)) -%}
    <article class="kh-summary kh-summary--news">
      {% set isNote = (post.data.tags and ('note' in post.data.tags))  %}
      <div class="kh-summary__date">{{ post.date | dateDisplay }}
      {% if isNote %}
       | Note post
      {% endif %}
      </div>
      {% if (not isNote) and post.data.image %}
        <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="kh-summary__image">
          <img width="300" class="kh-summary__image" src="/images{{ post.data.image }}" alt="{{ post.data.title }}">
        </a>
      {% endif %}
      <h3 class="kh-summary__title">
        <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="kh-summary__link">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
      </h3>
      <p class="kh-content kh-summary__text">{{ post.data.teaser | safe }}</p>
      {#- {{loop.index}} -#}
    </article>
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
    <article class="kh-summary kh-summary--news">
      <h3 class="kh-summary__title">
        <a href="/blog" class="kh-summary__link">Read {{ collections.posts | length - 3}} more posts on the blog ↦</a>
      </h3>
    </article>
  </section>

</section>

{#- Contact -#}
